  "subject": {
    "id": "ccd12-r3-governance",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Promote the exact OD-012 R3 wheel-derivation policy into graph revision 14.",
  "why": "The operator replacement needs current prose and semantic projections, a hard governance guard, and immutable evidence before workstream states can be restored. Revision 14 creates a distinct R3 object that supersedes R2, preserves all R2 coordinates, and binds the derivative-input, payload/license identity, non-impersonation, double-transform, v3 evidence, runtime exclusion, ownership, and future-replacement boundaries."
